        "TileImage": "$($repository 56e854bc-f006-4cc6-99d9-85fc6898901d).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47.\r\rToday our client is Charles Blake the third. He&apos;s a part of a poker club called the Randoms. Turns out the five people playing had made a scheme and won 2.3 milion off Charles&apos;s money. Today they are going to play winner takes all. But if they don&apos;t show up Charles gets all their poker chips. That&apos;s what I like to call a street flush. Be careful some of them are well trained and have guns.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
